abstract: >-
  Forward and inverse physics-informed neural networks, local identifiability
  analyses, Bayesian experiments, and neural-mechanistic hybrids for a
  seven-state WNT-RA-HOX model. The research uses synthetic data.
keywords:
  - physics-informed neural networks
  - ordinary differential equations
  - identifiability
  - scientific machine learning
